==Description==
The '''Green Nametag''' is a {{Color|Common}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|500}}.

The '''Green Nametag''' has green gradient text and a slightly translucent dark green outline. Green fog and green sparks appear behind the text. The first version instead was far simpler, only having green text with a translucent black outline.

